  "problem": "A tutoring center offers private lesson packages. When the price of a package is $$40,$ the center books all $80$ available sessions. For every $$4$ increase in the package price, one fewer session is booked. If the cost of providing each session is $$16,$ what price should the center charge to maximize its profit?\n\nTo maximize profit, the center should charge $$$\n{{field-1}}\nper session.",
